WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.070
Silicon Valley takes in
all of Santa Clara County,

2
00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:05.910
California, plus nearby cities.

3
00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:08.390
About 3 million people live there.

4
00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:15.210
In Santa Clara County, the median
household income is 164,281 dollars.

5
00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:21.390
For the USA as a whole, it is
80,734 dollars: about half.

6
00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:24.330
In Palo Alto, beside Stanford University,

7
00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:28.270
it reaches 231,101 dollars.

8
00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:31.610
A county on about twice
the national income.

9
00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:34.570
So could any part of it need regeneration?

10
00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:37.330
In this mission, you'll
measure that success:

11
00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:41.950
high employment, inward migration,
and deprivation that stays low.

12
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:46.130
Then you'll set Silicon Valley beside a
declining region of the Rust Belt, and

13
00:00:46.180 --> 00:00:47.170
compare.

14
00:00:47.220 --> 00:00:52.180
Your mission: decide whether any part
of this rich region needs regeneration.
